WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.536
- The media stuff is so
shocking to me because I,

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.472
you know, I worked
at CNN for years

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:08.375
and I posted a couple shows
there or several shows there,

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.243
and then I, you know,
I was the main anchor

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:13.346
in MSNBC for four
years, I got fired.

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:16.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you know, I still
have a really good friend

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:18.018
who remain nameless,

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:20.286 align:start size:84% position:16%
who works there, still
a wonderful person,
really good guy,

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.088
and I have a couple
of friends at CNN.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:24.991
So not a ton, two,

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:27.861
but anyway, but I know that
world really, really well.

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:31.131 align:start size:97% position:3%
And the biggest surprise for
me in one sentence is how

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:32.298
illiberal they are.

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:34.601 align:start size:88% position:13%
I always imagined
their liberal networks.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.770
No, no, no, I'm liberal, okay?

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:37.971
In the sense that like,

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:39.606
I believe in the enlightenment

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:41.875
and I believe in
the bill of rights

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.710
and I think we do have rights.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:46.780
They are not liberals.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.749
They are defenders
of the powerful,

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:51.684
which is the much graver sin.

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:53.953 align:start size:88% position:13%
Like, you can have silly
politics, I get it.

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:55.989 align:start size:88% position:13%
I've had silly politics,
maybe I do now.

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:57.390
People make mistakes,

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.093
but defending the
billionaire class,

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:02.028
blaming everything on like

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:04.864 align:start size:94% position:6%
working class white people
who are like, you know,

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:08.234 align:start size:88% position:13%
by far the most shafted
people in America.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.136
Look at the suicide rate,
look at the death rate.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:11.905
I mean, it's like,
it's measurable,

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.339
but everything's their fault?

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:17.077
(bright music)

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:22.348 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
- I'm Dave Rubin
