00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:09.596
And so, yeah, I live in my barn.

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:12.098
- So you're kind
of living the dream

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:13.700
that you always wanted in a way.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:14.767
I mean, a couple of years ago,

