the mainstream cred.

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:40.426
- Well, yeah, I mean,

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:42.762 align:start size:84% position:16%
I have to say, I've
always believed

00:02:42.762 --> 00:02:44.931
