00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:47.500
What do you do when you wake up?

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:48.635
What time do you wake up?

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:50.103
Who do you wake up with?

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:52.939 align:start size:97% position:3%
I mean, those are the things
