00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:44.057
you're just trying to do
what you think is right

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:46.759
as a journalist and as
a personality and then

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:49.495 align:start size:94% position:6%
how it affects the life
and the people around you.

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:51.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Yeah, I mean, it was
just sad to see it happen.

00:03:51.831 --> 00:03:53.633
I moved to Washington as a kid.

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:56.402
My dad worked for the
federal government

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:57.870
on the cold war,

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
and doing pretty honorable
things, I would say,

00:03:59.439 --> 00:04:01.007
I think that anyway.

00:04:01.007 --> 00:04:03.343
And so I've lived in Washington

00:04:03.343 --> 00:04:06.846 align:start position:0%
essentially my whole adult
life, I mean since high school.

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:09.983 align:start size:97% position:3%
And it's a bipartisan town,
I mean, by definition,

00:04:09.983 --> 00:04:11.784
both parties are represented,

00:04:11.784 --> 00:04:13.253
both parties live there.

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:14.754
And as a result,

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:16.923
