00:04:45.585 --> 00:04:47.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
that they were completely
threatened by him.

00:04:47.754 --> 00:04:48.988
I mean, it really
threatened by him.

00:04:48.988 --> 00:04:52.358 align:start size:88% position:13%
It was like a foreign
power occupying the city

00:04:52.358 --> 00:04:54.427
