00:05:08.675 --> 00:05:10.610 align:start size:88% position:13%
I really agree with
that and I always have.

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:15.615
So the division in
the city between

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:18.518
the overwhelming majority
