00:05:21.688 --> 00:05:23.690
well, yeah, okay, Trump,

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:25.992
whatever, you know, he's got
all these personal faults,

00:05:25.992 --> 00:05:29.295 align:start size:88% position:13%
got it, but he's making
really good points.

00:05:29.295 --> 00:05:30.863
Like, what is the
point of NATO.\?

