off to boarding school

00:06:21.214 --> 00:06:23.349
and we didn't have any kids
at home and sort of like,

00:06:23.349 --> 00:06:24.817
well, wait, you know,

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:26.652
why don't we just move to where
