00:06:26.652 --> 00:06:27.820
So we did.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.589
- Yeah, do you think

00:06:29.589 --> 00:06:32.024
that the people that
you're talking about

00:06:32.024 --> 00:06:34.994
there that are sort of
the permanent DC class

00:06:34.994 --> 00:06:37.029 align:start size:84% position:16%
