00:07:02.622 --> 00:07:05.691 align:start size:97% position:3%
because you're carrying the
torch for some of those ideas.

00:07:05.691 --> 00:07:08.661
- Yeah, I mean, I'm not
totally aware of that.

00:07:08.661 --> 00:07:10.596
I have a kind of
peripheral sense

00:07:10.596 --> 00:07:13.599
that I'm disliked by some
people, but, you know,

00:07:13.599 --> 00:07:15.101
I don't have a television,

00:07:15.101 --> 00:07:17.236
I don't go on the internet,
I don't use social media.

00:07:17.236 --> 00:07:19.472 align:start size:84% position:16%
I'm pretty insulated
from that stuff

00:07:19.472 --> 00:07:20.840
because why would
I look in my head?

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:21.774
- You literally don't,

00:07:21.774 --> 00:07:22.942
I know you don't check Twitter,

00:07:22.942 --> 00:07:24.911 align:start size:88% position:13%
but you literally don't
have a television?

00:07:24.911 --> 00:07:25.778
- Oh, no, I've never had it.

00:07:25.778 --> 00:07:27.280
I've never had a TV, no.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.114
- Wow.

00:07:28.114 --> 00:07:29.315
- No, I just didn't,

00:07:29.315 --> 00:07:30.750
I didn't grow up like that and

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:32.819
my dad worked in TV
when I was a kid and

00:07:33.953 --> 00:07:35.354 align:start size:84% position:16%
he was pretty pro
