00:07:37.056 --> 00:07:39.992 align:start size:97% position:3%
So yeah, we had a lot of
enforced reading in our house,

00:07:39.992 --> 00:07:41.794 align:start size:84% position:16%
and so I think
that's how I grew up.

00:07:42.929 --> 00:07:45.998 align:start size:84% position:16%
But mostly, you
know, I have a very

00:07:45.998 --> 00:07:48.801
