00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.856
So I feel like I've
got a pretty good

00:08:09.856 --> 00:08:13.960 align:start size:97% position:3%
series of backstops against
going totally crazy.

00:08:15.127 --> 00:08:16.662 align:start size:84% position:16%
And then I really care
about their opinion

00:08:16.662 --> 00:08:19.198 align:start size:88% position:13%
