00:08:49.996 --> 00:08:53.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I would never go online
and like Google myself.

00:08:53.099 --> 00:08:54.100
Why would I do that?

00:08:55.201 --> 00:08:56.035
What's the upside?

00:08:56.035 --> 00:08:57.637
- I Know you mean it.

00:08:57.637 --> 00:08:58.471
Right, exactly.

00:08:58.471 --> 00:08:59.705
I know you mean it,

00:08:59.705 --> 00:09:01.340
