00:26:54.346 --> 00:26:55.614
even when I was a kid,

00:26:55.614 --> 00:26:56.548 align:start size:97% position:3%
you know, my
great-grandmother was like,

00:26:56.548 --> 00:26:58.550
well, who was from their family,

00:26:58.550 --> 00:27:00.719
was like, Teddy Roosevelt, bad,

00:27:01.886 --> 00:27:03.722
but I always thought
he was a cool guy.

00:27:05.924 --> 00:27:07.425
And so I liked him
for those reasons.

00:27:07.425 --> 00:27:10.695
Now, as I age, I realized
what a wise man he was.

00:27:10.695 --> 00:27:11.696 align:start size:84% position:16%
He was just an
extraordinary person.

00:27:11.696 --> 00:27:13.264
He believed in capitalism,

00:27:13.264 --> 00:27:14.866
he believed in democracy,

00:27:14.866 --> 00:27:16.601 align:start size:84% position:16%
he was actually
deeply conservative,

00:27:16.601 --> 00:27:18.303
he didn't want radical change.

00:27:18.303 --> 00:27:22.907 align:start size:84% position:16%
There was massive
global technological
change on his watch.

00:27:22.907 --> 00:27:24.275 align:start size:84% position:16%
It was called the
industrial revolution,

00:27:24.275 --> 00:27:26.111
and it reached its kind of apex

00:27:26.111 --> 00:27:29.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
around 1,990 to 1901
when he became president,

00:27:29.280 --> 00:27:34.285
and it unleashed all kinds of
like super volatile politics.

00:27:35.720 --> 00:27:38.056
And in fact, it culminated
in the Bolshevik Revolution,

00:27:38.056 --> 00:27:41.393
October, 1917, which enslaved
half the world for 50 years.

00:27:41.393 --> 00:27:45.330
So like these technological
changes have affects that,

00:27:45.330 --> 00:27:46.598 align:start size:84% position:16%
you know, are
really, really deep,

00:27:46.598 --> 00:27:48.066
and Roosevelt could see this.

00:27:48.066 --> 00:27:49.934
It was anarchism, not
communism at the time,

00:27:49.934 --> 00:27:52.103 align:start size:94% position:6%
but the anarchist movement
was killing people like

00:27:52.103 --> 00:27:53.371
all over the country.

00:27:53.371 --> 00:27:54.639
In Chicago, Denver,

00:27:55.707 --> 00:27:58.209 align:start size:88% position:13%
you know, Butte,
Montana, New York City,

00:27:58.209 --> 00:27:59.844
